        {
          "index": 1,
          "type": "input",
          "title": "You'll want to know: ചരക്ക്",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ചരക്ക് — carakkŭ — \"goods; cargo\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "തുറമുഖത്ത് ധാരാളം ചരക്ക് ഉണ്ടായിരുന്നു. tuṟamukhattŭ dhārāḷaṁ carakkŭ uṇṭāyirunnu. There was a lot of cargo at the port."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "You met it inside പലചരക്ക്, groceries: many goods."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ചരക്ക് (carakkŭ) is native Dravidian, \"merchandise, cargo\" (DEDR 2353). The same word sits inside പലചരക്ക്, groceries."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "One more word for getting around."
